Z||000003||theogre||08-18-2001||07:34 PM||||<A HREF="http://www.kickhill.com/" TARGET=_blank>Kick Hill Farm</A><P>You may also be able to rob one from another GM car with the same ecm. That ECM isn't as picky about which car it's in as the DIS ECM. In your case you mainly need to worry that it's a stick 4 cyl. (Prom from an automatic could have issues.)||||reg||1
