Z||000005||Dave Gunsul||08-19-2001||12:34 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by theogre:<BR><B><A HREF="http://www.kickhill.com/" TARGET=_blank>Kick Hill Farm</A><P>(Prom from an automatic could have issues.)</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I think you have that backwards. The stick chip in an auto is the one that will cause problems because the stick prom doens't have any of the shifting crap that the auto needs.<BR>Unless i'm mixed up,it's been a long day after all.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
